                                                "sense_id": "0c3f8e0c-1a2d-372a-ba8d-d6d4dcbc9500",
                                                "text": "For the college clinician, restless nights after letting a shaky student walk out of the office are an occupational hazard. Are the student's safety assurances credible? Will he or she make it safely through the weekend?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "31cab3cc-0969-4ce8-b473-8b59bcf1c04e",
                                                "sense_id": "0c3f8e0c-1a2d-372a-ba8d-d6d4dcbc9500",
                                                "text": "Villa had plenty of opportunities to make the game safe after a shaky start and despite not reaching any great heights, they were resolute enough to take control of the game in the second half."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00f5004f-c3b9-35e3-aa38-a8f23b65a915",
